*STEP,NLGEOM
 STEP #1: DISPLACE TEST SPECIMEN SO FINAL SHAPE IS
          IDENTICAL TO INITIAL SHAPE OF REFERENCE ELEMENT 
*STATIC
0.25,1.
*PRINT,MODEL CHANGE=YES
*BOUNDARY,OP=NEW
